  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7338f25d66e39394591110f0040ac51d, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 980ddc03b023c10499776b92e2a3600e, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7b18649186574d144bc3eafec5cd49f2, type: 3}
  texts:
  - "It began with Saturn\u2019s demise. The planet cracked, its remains hurled across
    the stars, as if the heavens themselves rejected what it had become"
  - "When the fragments struck Earth, they didn\u2019t just destroy\u2014they corrupted.
    The impact warped the land, and the fragments twisted life into something new
    and grotesque"
  - "Five years passed. The world was fractured\u2014its people even more so. Two
    factions emerged: the Dominion, seeking order through technology, and the Vagabonds,
    thriving in chaos and mutation"
  - To eliminate the growing threat, Dominion forces were deployed into the Vagabond-controlled
    wild zones. They underestimated what awaited them
  - "But the wastelands were not empty. The Vagabonds had grown stronger\u2014armed
    with salvaged tech, mutant beasts, and doctrine. The Dominion squad was outnumbered,
    overwhelmed... and taken. Dragged beneath the surface into labs fueled by madness"
  - "One of the marines endured. Subjected to unspeakable experiments, his mind drowned
    in chemicals meant to make him a puppet. But something within broke through.
    Rage, instinct, memory\u2014they tore apart the drugs meant to chain him. He
    awoke in fury, tearing free of his chains and ripping through the Vagabond scientists
    with brutal force\u2014turning the lab into a slaughterhouse of blood and fire"
  - "His name is forgotten. His past\u2014erased. But his purpose burned bright:
    to cleanse the world of beasts and those who made him one"
  - "Now he hunts. Mutated creatures, twisted warlords, corrupted factions\u2026
    all fall beneath his blade. He is no longer a soldier\u2014he is the reckoning"
  - "No allies. No name. Only a path carved in blood. This is his world now. This...
    is the age of the\_Mutant\_Slayer"
